-- title:
--   Pole-chart integrality over A[1/j] at level N
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime, let $A$ be a valuation subring of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$, let $N\ge 1$, let $k$ be a field of characteristic $q$, let $\mathrm{red}\colon A\to k$ be a ring homomorphism, and assume $q\nmid N$. Let $t$ be an element of `modularFunctionFieldBar N`, the intermediate field of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}\,((\!(q)\!))$ over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ generated by the coefficientwise images of the $\mathbb{Q}$-field generated by the divisor expansions of level $N$. Assume: (i) the Laurent series underlying $t$ lies in `CharPReduction.modularLocalized (N * q) A.toSubring red`, that is, $t\,s=r$ for some $r,s$ in the subring of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}\,((\!(q)\!))$ generated by the constant series with coefficients in $A$ together with the series $j$ and $j$ of level $Nq$, with $s$ outside the prime ideal cut out by $\mathrm{red}$ on that ring; (ii) for every place $u_0$ of `modularFunctionFieldBar N` over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ — a proper valuation subring containing the image of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ and a principal ideal ring — whose valuation subring contains $(\,\overline{j}_N)^{-1}$, it also contains $t$. Then $t$ is integral over `CharPModel.affineBaseInf N A`, the subring of `modularFunctionFieldBar N` generated by the constants from $A$ together with $(\overline{j}_N)^{-1}$: there is a monic polynomial $p$ over that subring with $p(t)=0$.
--
--   This is the Gauss-lemma step on the chart at the pole of $j$: Gauss-integrality at level $Nq$ together with pole-freeness at the characteristic-zero places where $1/j$ is finite forces integrality over $A[1/j]$, the counterpart of the affine-chart statement with $A[j]$ in place of $A[1/j]$. It is used in the construction of charts for specialisations of places, in particular for the behaviour at the cusp $\infty$ and for places that are not affine geometric places.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_CharPModel_exists_monic_eval2_affineBaseInf_eq_zero_of_mem_modularLocalized_of_forall_inv_jBar_mem.lean

